DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260911
DTSTAMP:20260910T144819Z
UID:96810be9438a8401ffdc60b08435@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This classic comedy opens on a friendly card game in the untid
 y apartment of divorced Oscar Madison. And if the mess is any indication\,
  it’s no wonder that his wife left him. Late to arrive is Felix Ungar\, 
 who has just been separated from his wife. Fastidious\, depressed\, and no
 ne too tense\, Felix seems suicidal\, but as the action unfolds\, Oscar be
 comes the one with murder on his mind when the clean freak and the slob ul
 timately decide to room together. The action unfolds with hilarious result
 s as The Odd Couple is born.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/odd-cou
 ple-0
LOCATION:The Legacy Theatre\, 128 Thimble Island Road\, Branford CT\, 0640
 5
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/odd-couple-0
END:VEVENT
